<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_19> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an addressee receives an electronic message, the addressee is entitled to regard each electronic message received as a separate electronic message and to act on that presumption, unless the addressee knew or should have known, had he exercised reasonable care or used any agreed procedure, that the electronic message was a duplicate. Time of dispatch"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
