<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the acknowledgement has not been received by the originator within the time specified or agreed or, if no time has been specified or agreed, within a reasonable time, the originator may —"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
