<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "give notice to the addressee stating that no acknowledgement has been received and specifying a reasonable time by which the acknowledgement must be received; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
