<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "if the acknowledgement is not received within the time specified in paragraph (a), give notice to the addressee to treat the electronic message as though it had never been sent and exercise any other rights he may have."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
