<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the originator receives the addressee's acknowledgement of receipt, it is presumed that the addressee received the related electronic message."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
