<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the received acknowledgement states that the related electronic message fulfills technical requirements, either agreed upon or set forth in applicable standards, it is presumed that those requirements have been fulfilled."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
