<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to section 3, this Act shall apply to any commercial transaction conducted through electronic means including commercial transactions by the Federal and State Governments."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
