<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall not apply to the transactions or documents specified in the Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
