<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may by order amend, vary, delete from or add to the Schedule. Use not mandatory"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/17/eng@> .
